  "data": {
    "parameterized": true,
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever this **[TRANSPORT](vsdata:core-rule/transports)** gets **selected to shoot** while it carries [embarked](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) units, resolve these steps in order:\n\n1. Pick at most X of the models embarked in it, other than models of units already **selected to shoot** in this phase.\n2. For each picked model, pick a ranged weapon it has, other than a **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:core-rule/one-shot)** weapon.\n3. The **TRANSPORT** has the picked weapons as well as its own until it has resolved all its attacks.\n4. Units embarked in it cannot shoot for the rest of the turn.",
